      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. it just feels like a lot of noise for no reason. all this fighting and hurting just to stay in a world that doesn't even know i'm here. wouldn't it be easier to just... stop? to just let the silence take over so i don't have to feel the weight of it all anymore?",
